# The closure guard's whitelist. SIX entries = the 3 covering axioms + the 3 uninterpreted
# predicates they quantify over — one fact at two granularities (canon §1.4). Order: axiom,
# then its carrier(s).
#
# --- covering axioms (the "no further kind" claims) ---
GFSO.FailureModes.evaluation_completeness
GFSO.Standards.morris_trichotomy
GFSO.Links.directed_action_completeness
# --- uninterpreted predicates the axioms quantify over (they localize the empirical residue) ---
GFSO.FailureModes.correct
GFSO.Links.Directed
GFSO.Standards.fullyKnown
